  "result": "Perfect! All 166 tests pass. I've successfully added a voucher system to invoices.\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n1. **Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error** to src/errors.js for attempts to apply multiple vouchers\n\n2. **Added applyVoucher() function** to src/invoices.js:\n   - Applies a fixed-amount voucher (in cents) to a draft invoice only\n   - Stores voucher as `{ code, amount }` on the invoice\n   - Constraints:\n     - Only one voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error)\n     - Draft invoices only (NOT_DRAFT error)\n     - amount must be positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID)\n   - Never mutates input invoice\n\n3. **Updated invoiceTotals()** to:\n   - Include `voucher` field (0 if no voucher applied)\n   - Calculate: total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n   - Clamps total to \u2265 0\n   - Returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n\n4. **Added 9 comprehensive tests** covering:\n   - Applying vouchers to draft invoices\n   - Voucher reducing the total\n   - Preventing multiple vouchers\n   - Preventing vouchers on non-draft invoices\n   - Invalid amount validation\n   - Immutability of original invoices\n   - Interaction with discounts and VAT\n   - Zero voucher for invoices without vouchers\n\nThe voucher is applied as a final deduction AFTER VAT, reducing the invoice total without affecting line-item calculations.",
